msgid "Applying Stops"
msgstr "应用止损"

#: ../../source/notebooks/8. 63d22be294814effbfc160a54157ed80 Applying
#: Stops.ipynb:11
msgid ""
"Stops automatically buy or sell a security once it reaches a specified "
"price level. They help limit potential losses by exiting bad trades, as "
"well as lock in profits by selling when a security reaches a target "
"price."
msgstr "止损可在证券达到指定价格水平时自动买入或卖出。它们既能通过退出糟糕的交易来限制潜在损失，也能在证券达到目标价格时卖出以锁定利润。"

